<title>USA: N.C. $106 mln Catawba bonds repriced, yields cut.</title>
<headline>N.C. $106 mln Catawba bonds repriced, yields cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co. said Wednesday it repriced North Carolina Municipal Power Agency's $106 million Catawba Electric revenue bonds, lowering yields two basis points in the 2015 and 2017 maturities.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>NORTH CAROLINA MUNICIPAL POWER AGENCY</p>
<p>RE: $105,965,000*</p>
<p>NUMBER 1</p>
<p>CATAWBA ELECTRIC REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>SERIES 1997A</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>NOTE REPRICING FOR THE 2015 &amp; 2017 MATURITIES.</p>
<p>NOTE THE DATED DATE AND DELIVERY DATE HAVE CHANGED.</p>
<p>  MOODY'S: Aaa		 S&amp;P: AAA		   FITCH: AAA</p>
<p>	     (A3)		     (A-)		  (A-)</p>
<p>MBIA INSURED</p>
<p>  DATED: 10/01/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 01/01/1998</p>
<p>DUE: 01/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>01/01/1998		  565M    5.00  %	  4.00</p>
<p>01/01/1999		2,465M    5.00  %	  4.25</p>
<p>01/01/2000		2,585M    5.00  %	  4.35</p>
<p>01/01/2001		2,715M    5.00  %	  4.45</p>
<p>01/01/2009		3,555M    5.00  %	  5.15</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>01/01/2010		3,735M    5.125 %	  5.25</p>
<p>01/01/2011	     13,925M    5.125 %	  5.30</p>
<p>01/01/2015	     19,105M    5.125 %	  5.43</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 96.603)</p>
<p>01/01/2017	     57,315M    5.125 %	  5.48</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 95.801)</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 01/01/2007    102.00</p>
<p>		   DTP 01/01/2009</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Friday, July 11, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on October 1, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
